00:06:09.335 --> 00:06:10.503
But how do people know they

00:06:10.503 --> 00:06:11.804
can trust the testing

00:06:13.439 --> 00:06:13.973
Well,

00:06:14.107 --> 00:06:15.341
I think

00:06:15.341 --> 00:06:16.242
in our part,

00:06:16.242 --> 00:06:17.677
you know, we're drinking the water, too.

00:06:17.677 --> 00:06:18.444
You know, I'm

00:06:18.444 --> 00:06:19.779
drinking at my family's drinking

00:06:19.779 --> 00:06:21.381
if I don't want to drink this stuff.

00:06:21.381 --> 00:06:22.382
So I want to make sure

00:06:22.382 --> 00:06:23.449
that we're doing that as good

00:06:23.449 --> 00:06:25.051
as job as we can to to

00:06:25.051 --> 00:06:26.652
