00:06:31.224 --> 00:06:32.525
And we feel that where we

00:06:32.525 --> 00:06:33.960
we have several barriers here.

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:35.395
We can we can remove it.

00:06:35.395 --> 00:06:36.262
And even before that,

00:06:36.262 --> 00:06:37.263
