00:06:37.263 --> 00:06:38.731
and not bring the water in for a while.

00:06:38.731 --> 00:06:39.799
So if we see the contaminants

00:06:39.799 --> 00:06:40.800
getting close to us,

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:42.935
that's usually our first action is just

00:06:43.236 --> 00:06:45.371
shut down and let it go by altogether.

00:06:45.371 --> 00:06:47.273
And one aspect of this is the rain.

00:06:47.273 --> 00:06:47.673
You know,

00:06:47.673 --> 00:06:48.841
I mean, we talked about the soil

00:06:48.841 --> 00:06:49.776
in East Palestine,

00:06:49.776 --> 00:06:51.544
