00:06:51.544 --> 00:06:53.813
What concerns do you have about that?

00:06:55.948 --> 00:06:57.183
Well, we have quickly

00:06:57.183 --> 00:06:59.085
our monitoring system that we have set up

00:06:59.085 --> 00:07:00.353
will detect something else

00:07:00.353 --> 00:07:00.853
