00:08:22.935 --> 00:08:24.971
that they're told the water is safe,

00:08:24.971 --> 00:08:26.606
but they're still told to drink

00:08:26.606 --> 00:08:27.507
bottled water.

00:08:27.507 --> 00:08:29.208
How did you do if you lived there?

00:08:29.208 --> 00:08:31.244
How do you square those two?

00:08:31.244 --> 00:08:31.744
Yeah.

00:08:32.011 --> 00:08:33.246
Well, I think what the Health

00:08:33.246 --> 00:08:34.113
Department of Health is saying

00:08:34.113 --> 00:08:35.248
is get your water tested.

00:08:35.248 --> 00:08:36.182
A lot of people up there

00:08:36.182 --> 00:08:37.783
in East Palestine

00:08:37.783 --> 00:08:39.752
have their own private wells.

00:08:39.752 --> 00:08:41.220
And that's a very different situation

00:08:41.220 --> 00:08:41.821
than what we have

00:08:41.821 --> 00:08:43.289
where we have a centralized drinking

00:08:43.289 --> 00:08:44.156
water system.

00:08:44.156 --> 00:08:44.957
So there is free

00:08:44.957 --> 00:08:46.759
testing that everybody is doing

00:08:46.759 --> 00:08:47.226
for those people.

00:08:47.226 --> 00:08:49.195
So absolutely, they should have

00:08:49.195 --> 00:08:50.763
the wells tested, not just now,

00:08:50.763 --> 00:08:52.532
but later on in the future to

00:08:52.532 --> 00:08:53.432
to make sure that nothing else

00:08:53.432 --> 00:08:54.600
gets into there.

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:55.968
Does it ever become a situation

00:08:55.968 --> 00:08:58.070
where do you think that is?

00:08:58.104 --> 00:08:59.572
Palestine should be designated

00:08:59.572 --> 00:09:01.641
as a Superfund site where it gets

00:09:01.641 --> 00:09:04.410
the federal attention in its it changes

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:05.211
the contamination

00:09:05.211 --> 00:09:06.512
and how they are

00:09:06.512 --> 00:09:07.880
allocating resources for it.

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:09.482
Should it be a Superfund site?

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:12.385
I don't know about a Superfund site.

00:09:12.385 --> 00:09:13.486
Both.
I certainly think that

00:09:13.486 --> 00:09:15.054
there needs to be a lot of effort

00:09:15.054 --> 00:09:17.189
put into it right now to characterize

00:09:17.189 --> 00:09:19.125
what's there, to clean up what's there.

00:09:19.125 --> 00:09:19.458
But yeah,

00:09:19.458 --> 00:09:20.893
I think they do need a lot of attention

00:09:20.893 --> 00:09:21.561
up there.

00:09:21.928 --> 00:09:22.662
All right, Jeff

00:09:22.662 --> 00:09:23.729
Fager,
thank you so much

00:09:23.729 --> 00:09:25.298
for sharing that expertize with us

00:09:25.298 --> 00:09:26.465
and your testing procedures

00:09:26.465 --> 00:09:27.800
and saying that you and your family

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:28.701
are drinking the water.

00:09:28.701 --> 00:09:31.571
And so you do believe it's safe

00:09:31.571 --> 00:09:32.538
Absolutely. Thank you.

